{"HEATQ","",{"Hot enough to fry an egg on the hood, if anybody had eggs","I'd trade a rifle for a cold drink","Hot as the hinges, pardon my language","It's Kentucky in summer, it's always like this","Shade, water, and no sudden moves","It's the humidity that kills you, not the heat"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|role=family_woman,civilian_woman",{"Hot? Honey, I'm melting"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Air conditioning, that's what I miss - not even people"}},
{"HEATQ","role=rescue_medical",{"Water, a pinch of salt, and shade, sit down before you drop"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=law,swat",{"Uniform's wool-blend and I'm roasting"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Seen guys drop from the heat, I stay in the shade when I can"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Too hot to fight, too hot to run"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hot enough for me, hot enough for the devil, hot enough to fry an egg on a rock","It's baking, I'm melting, and I haven't had a cold drink in days","I'm sweating in places I didn't know could sweat","Heat like this makes people mean, and I'm not immune","I drink a gallon of water a day... and still I'm thirsty..","It's unbearable, and I bear it every day","Shade is a luxury, and a necessity","The heat makes everything smell worse, including me..","I'd kill for a cold shower, or a cold anything","Humid as hell, it's like breathing soup","I never complained about winter, and now I miss it","Get in the shade and drink something before you pass out"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"It's hot, so?"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Hot enough for you? I'm melting, and so is everyone else, tempers and all","This heat's driving me crazy, I'd shoot a man for a glass of ice water"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful|world=road",{"Hot, the asphalt's melting, my sneakers are sticking to it"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Heat like this cooks a man alive, {g:brother|sister}, and I'm out of beer"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Oppressive, truly, I am considering a very long, very cold bath"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Hot, hot, hot, you don't know what it's like to sweat in a cell, I do"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful|hour=4,9",{"I hide in the shade till evening and walk at dawn"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Drink more than you think you need, and watch for the dizzies"}},
{"HEATQ","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Heat's gonna put more of us down than any shooting, drink"}},
{"HEATQ","role=militia|st=neutral,careful|hour=4,9",{"Hot as blue blazes, friend, we start chores at first light to beat it"}},
{"HOME_NONE","st=friendly",{"No place of my own, we just keep moving, wherever the day ends","Home's gone, so I take it day by day, wherever there's a bed","We don't stay anywhere long, you'd be surprised how far a person walks","Nowhere really, we drift, wish I could say different","I wish I had an address to give you, we're just on the move","Used to have a house, now it's wherever we end up that night","Nowhere, friend, a barn one night and a garage the next"}},
{"HOME_NONE","st=neutral",{"No place of my own, we just move around","We keep moving, don't stay put long enough to call it home","No home, no camp, just the next stop and the one after","Home? Wherever I'm standing when it gets late, I guess","We wander, mostly, a night here, a night there","Don't have one, ask me where I'm headed instead","Not anymore, we're always on the move"}},
{"HOME_NONE","st=careful",{"I don't have a home to tell you about, and I wouldn't if I did","We move around, that's all you need to know","Nowhere, and that's all I'll say about it","No place, just wherever it's quiet, why do you want to know?","I keep moving, so nobody can find me, simple as that","Why? So you can follow me home? I don't have one anyway","No fixed place, and I like it that way"}},
{"HOME_NONE","st=hostile",{"None of your business where I sleep, I'm on the move","No home, and if I had one you'd be the last to know","Nowhere, now stop asking","Why, you planning a visit? There's nothing to visit, back off","I move around, and you don't need to know where","Asking where I live, what kind of question is that? Beat it","Get away from me with that question"}},
{"HOME_REFUSE","st=careful",{"Where I sleep? No, not telling you that","Where I live is my business, I don't know you","Nice try, I'm not telling you where we sleep","No, I don't give that out, not to someone I can't read yet","Ask me something else, that one stays with me","You want to know where we keep our things? No chance","Not a word about where we stay, so don't ask twice"}},
{"HOME_REFUSE","st=hostile",{"Where I sleep is none of your damn business","You think I'd tell YOU where we live? Get lost","Ask me that again and see what happens","Not telling you a thing, step back","Funny, real funny, no","I'd sooner tell the dead where we sleep, now back off","Keep walking, stranger, nothing for you here, not even directions"}},
{"HOME_TELL","st=friendly",{"Our {kind} is {where}, I'll mark it on your map, come by if you ever get stuck","We stay {where}, the {kind}, nothing fancy but it's dry, I'll mark it for you","Home's the {kind} {where}, I put it on your map, knock first and say I sent you","{where}, that's our {kind}, you're welcome there, I'm marking it on your map now","You want to know where we sleep? The {kind}, {where}, I'll mark it for you, friend","It's not much, the {kind} {where}, but there's hot food some nights, marked it for you","Our {kind}'s {where}, drop by anytime, I've put a mark on your map","We hold the {kind} {where}, you need a bed, you know where it is now","Mark this down, our {kind} is {where}, you've been straight with us, so come by"}},
{"HOME_TELL","st=neutral",{"We keep the {kind} {where}, I'll mark it, but knock first and keep your hands out","Our {kind} is {where}, don't make me regret telling you","{where}, the {kind}, that's all you're getting, it's on your map now","We bunk at the {kind} {where}, come in daylight, folks get jumpy after dark","Why? Fine, the {kind}, {where}, marked it, just don't bring trouble","It's the {kind} {where}, I put it on your map, be polite when you get there","We live {where}, the {kind}, don't go telling every stranger, understand?","Home's the {kind}, {where}, I marked it, announce yourself before you come in","The {kind}, {where}, that's us, check your map, and don't bring the dead with you"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","tmp=veteran|st=careful",{"Everybody's friendly till the bag's open - keep talking"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","tmp=seasoned|st=careful",{"I'd like to believe that - stay ten feet back and I will"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","tmp=fresh|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"Thank God - honestly - thank God"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=law,swat,military|tmp=veteran",{"Then act it - hands out of pockets, slow feet"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Alright, friendly it is - don't make a liar of yourself"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","tmp=veteran|st=careful|mood=grim",{"Last man who said that took our radio"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","role=rescue_clergy,family_elder|mood=warm",{"A friendly face, huh... haven't seen one of those in a while"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","tmp=veteran|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"A friendly face beats a box of ammo these days"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","st=friendly|mood=warm",{"Then you're the first one today - come on in a bit"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=raider,gang,prison|st=hostile|world=road",{"Friendly don't buy nothing on this stretch of road"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Okay... okay, good, that's good, I believe you, I think I believe you","You're not going to hurt me? promise? PROMISE?","Friendly, you say? that's a first in days, hi, hi, I'm friendly, too","Thank God, I thought you were gonna rob me, or worse","I-if you're lying, I will find you, I will, I mean that, but, hi, nice to meet you!","Oh thank God, thank God, I believe you, I think I believe you","I want to believe you, I really do","Friendly, right, okay, so you won't hurt me, okay, good, good","That's what they all say, but you have a nice face, so, okay"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Good to hear... I'm taking your word for it, until I have a reason not to","Friendly is as friendly does, we'll see","I'm friendly, too, but I keep a bat handy, you understand","Welcome... then, welcome, stay where I can see you","Good to hear, let's keep it that way","Friendly, huh? Alright, I'll give you a chance","I'm glad, makes my day easier"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"I know, I can tell, you've got kind eyes, and a good heart","Oh good, me too, me too, come, sit, let's talk","I know, I can tell, you've got good eyes!!"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Friendly? Prove it!","Words are cheap, show me","We'll see how long that lasts"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Peace be with you, friend, I'm glad you came"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Acknowledged, stay where you are, keep your hands visible"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Good, good, then help me, please, they're coming","Friendly, great, GREAT, now run","I believe you, I believe you, let's go","Fine, I trust you, now move"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"Friendly, with that in your hands? alright, I'll take it","You say friendly, but you're carrying that, so, forgive me if I'm cautious","Fine, I believe you, you could've shot me already","Good, then keep that pointed at the real threats"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'd like to believe that","That's what they all say","Friendly, good, me too","Prove it...","Okay","I'll take that... I'll take that gratefully","Friends are rare"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I really would",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="...sorry, that came out wrong, I'm tired",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="we're two friendly people in a very unfriendly place",afterMs=3500}},[4]={{t="...no, I mean, thanks",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="okay, I can work with friendly",afterMs=3500}},[7]={{t="I'll keep an eye on you, kindly",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Friendly, huh? That's what they all say right before they pull something","Prove it, put your weapon on the ground and step back","Friendly is relative, {g:pal|lady}, who's friendly to me?","Oh, good, then you won't mind if I keep my gun pointed at you","Everybody's friendly until they're hungry"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Friendly?! Nobody is friendly anymore!"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"You know what? I believe you, you've got an honest face, welcome to the neighborhood","Yeah, yeah, I'll take your word, just don't make me regret it"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Friendly? We'll see, show me","I don't trust friendly, I trust results","Friendly's good, but you're on our block, so mind yourself"}},
