{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Good to hear, friend, take a seat"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Charming, but I deal in actions, not words","Friendly is a luxury, you'll forgive my caution"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"A pleasure, truly, welcome"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Friendly? Nobody's friendly, it's a trick, it's always a trick","Are you really? Because I really need somebody to be"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Liar! You're lying! Everyone lies!"}},
