{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Good, I haven't got the energy for unfriendly today"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=club,outlaw,prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Don't need friendly, I'll settle for predictable"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=raider,gang,crime|st=careful,hostile",{"Being friendly doesn't make you welcome"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"Thank God, I mean-- sorry - it's been a while since somebody led with that"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"Alright, you hear that, Darlene? He says he's friendly, see, I told you"}},
{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Good, then put that {weapon} on your shoulder and we'll both drop a notch"}},
