{"I_AM_FRIENDLY","reg=outlaw,crime|tmp=seasoned|st=hostile",{"Words are cheap and getting cheaper - show me friendly, don't tell me friendly"}},
{"LAUGH","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Heh... heh, ha, sorry, I haven't laughed in days, it feels weird, it feels wrong, it feels good","Ha! oh God, that felt good, thanks, I needed that","Hahaha- ha- sorry, sorry, I can't stop, I think I'm losing it","You're right, it IS funny, in a sick, twisted way, ha","Stop it, you're going to make me cry, I'm laughing and crying, what's wrong with me?","Ha.. ha.. ha-ha-HA, oh God, I can't stop, I can't stop laughing","Hahaha- sorry- sorry- haha- I haven't laughed in so long- hah-","Heh.. heh.. ha.. oh, that's the first time in days..","Ha, ha, was that funny? It was funny, wasn't it? I'm laughing, you're laughing","Heh, sorry, I laugh when I'm uneasy, this is me laughing, uneasily","Hahaha, oh God, I haven't laughed in so long, my stomach hurts"}},
{"LAUGH","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hah... good one, I'll give you that, good one..","That's funny, that's actually funny, haven't heard something funny in a while","Ha, thanks, I needed that, we all did","Heh, heh, you've still got a sense of humor, I like that","Heh","Ha..","Ha, I'll allow it","Heh, you're easy to please, I like that","There it is, that's the sound I've been missing"},false,false,{[5]={{t="good one",afterMs=2200}},[6]={{t="damn, that's funny",afterMs=2200}}}},
{"LAUGH","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Ha! You're a riot, you know that? a real riot","Aww, that's wonderful, laughter's the best medicine, they say!","Ha, ha, ha, it's good to laugh, I forgot how it felt","Hahaha, stop, you're making me cry, in a good way","Ha! Oh God, I needed that","Heh, heh, don't stop, it's the first time I've smiled all week"}},
