{"LAUGH","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"That did my heart good, haven't laughed like that in weeks"}},
{"LAUGH","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Ha, noted, dark humor is permitted, within limits"}},
{"LAUGH","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"You laughing at me? I'll give you something to laugh about","Ha, ha, ha, that's rich, what a world we live in","Funny? You think this is funny? It's hilarious, actually","Go ahead, laugh, it's the only thing left that's free"}},
