{"LOWER_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Oh!! Sorry, I didn't even realize I was pointing it, there, down, DOWN!","Shit, sorry, I'm just so tired, my hands won't stop... it's down, see?","I'm lowering it, I'm lowering it, please don't be mad, please...","You're right, you're right, I'm scared, that's all, I'm just so damn scared","Down, down it goes, I don't even know how to use it properly, God","Sorry!! I kept it up out of habit, I wasn't going to shoot you, honest"}},
{"LOWER_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Alright, lowered, but I'm not putting it away, not out here","You're no threat, I guess, down it goes","There, it's down, anything else you want to nitpick?","Fine, but don't think I'm trusting you yet","Okay, easing it down, you look harmless enough"}},
{"LOWER_WEAPON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,hostile",{"You lower yours first and then we'll talk","It stays up until I know you're not a threat","No, I'm keeping it right where it is"}},
