{"MAYBE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Maybe? Maybe what? Maybe yes? Maybe no? I can't take maybe","Oh, great, maybe, my favorite word, ha","M-maybe is better than no, I'll hold on to maybe","I wish you'd just say yes or no, maybe is torture","M-maybe? Okay -- okay, I can live with maybe, for now","Maybe... I'll take that as a good sign","Hmm, a maybe, I'll light a candle for it","Maybe? That's all I get? Okay","Alright, maybe it is, we'll see how maybe feels tomorrow","M-maybe... I get it, I do, I'm the same way","Maybe? Okay, maybe is better than no, I'll take maybe","Maybe, right, I say maybe too, when I'm terrified","A maybe, okay, I'll hold on to it, like a little candle"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Maybe's fine, take your time","Don't strain yourself, maybe's an answer...","A maybe is as good as a no, usually","Think it over, then, I'm not going anywhere","Maybe it is -- maybe it isn't","Decide whenever you like","Maybe works for me","Hm, noncommittal, I like it","Okay, we'll leave it open","Take your time, we have plenty of it","Maybe, huh? That's the same as 'I don't want to say no'","Maybe means yes if you push it, no if you don't, so I won't push","Maybe, take your time, sleep on it"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Maybe? Not a good enough answer","Make up your mind","Maybe isn't going to get you any closer to me - stay put"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Maybe? Maybe isn't an answer, {g:pal|lady}, make up your mind","Maybe, maybe, maybe, you're going to get yourself shot with indecision","I don't do maybe, it's yes or no, or I decide for you","Hm, maybe is what people say when they're stalling, aren't you?"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Maybe?! Say yes or no, or I'll decide for you!"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Okay, think about it, take your time, I'm not going anywhere"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Maybe? I need a straight answer","Don't \"maybe\" me, say what you mean","Maybe is a no that doesn't have the guts"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Yes or no, don't waste my time!"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Alright, sleep on it"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Maybe? {g:Brother|Sister}, you've got to commit to something","A maybe is a lie that hasn't happened yet","Fine, think it over, but don't take too long"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Yes or no! Don't dodge!"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"No rush, friend, take your time"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Indecision is expensive, I'd advise you to decide","Maybe is not an answer I can work with"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Take your time, we got all day"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Maybe? What does that mean? Is it a trick? Are you trying to trick me?","Maybe... fine, I'll wait around"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't play games with me!"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"Whatever you need, I'm not going nowhere"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Maybe is as good as I'm gonna get, I suppose","Think on it, friend, don't be hasty"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"No pressure, friend, whenever you're ready"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Maybe is not helpful, I need a clear answer","Take a moment, but don't take too long"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Yes or no, now!"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Of course, think it over, there's no rush"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Maybe is not an acceptable response"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Yes or no, I don't have all day!"}},
{"MAYBE","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Take your time, friend"}},
{"MAYBE","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"Maybe? I don't know either! Is that okay? Should we both think?"}},
